BionicX includes modified source code from Winlator's Android application and
in-process X server:

  Project: https://github.com/brunodev85/winlator-app
  Source snapshot: c2f4ad4534f4637b543a9a3b085e28f50cf6d01c
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1

The Winlator-derived files remain under LGPL-2.1. Additional third-party
notices and licenses are retained in the Android source tree. BionicX does not
redistribute WPS Office or a glibc root filesystem.

The optional PulseAudio-to-AAudio host service uses the PulseAudio executable,
modules and dependent Android libraries from the same Winlator source snapshot.
Their acquisition script pins and verifies every binary input. PulseAudio is
licensed under LGPL-2.1; its corresponding source is available from the
Winlator source link above and https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/PulseAudio/.
